    "chapterId": 95,
    "fileId": 10583,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "<p>Insular carcinoid</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Closely apposed nests punctuated by multiple acini, some displaying eosinophilic secretions. Acini are lined by cells with round nuclei showing salt-and-pepper chromatin. Note the presence of neuroendocrine granules at the base of cells.</p>",
